File Index

/normalizePluginModule.ts
Purpose: Normalizes plugin module structure and validates data types for consistent plugin handling.

/pluginCss.ts
Purpose: Manages dynamic CSS styling for plugins with unique identifiers.

/pluginHost.ts
Purpose: Manages plugin lifecycle, execution, and communication within the game client.

/pluginScriptRunner.ts
Purpose: Runs bundled plugin scripts as triggers, timers, or aliases within a runtime environment.

/registry.ts
Purpose: Registers and provides access to all core plugins for the game client.

/routed-gmcp-events.ts
Purpose: Defines all GMCP and custom game events routed through the client application.
